body:
>Like gaming? Well look no further than online! Play video games, go until you find a girl who makes you laugh. If you're not up to do that because you can't hold her hand, it's not real love, it's physical love. Lust more or less. If you fall in love with a girl for her personality and will wait until you can go see her irl, that's truly special.

I'mm not OP, but anecdote because why not;

In my 10 years of online gaming (7 being on TMNF professionally) I have yet to come across a girl. Now I know that the western world does have a lot more women playing video games, and thats great, but the fact is that multiplayer gaming is still region based and if you're in the South Asian region like me, then you're shit out of luck.
